    'Kenya is the world\'s most iconic safari destination — the country that defined the word "safari" for generations of travellers. From the vast open grasslands of the Masai Mara to the snow-capped peak of Kilimanjaro viewed across Amboseli\'s elephant plains, Kenya offers a breadth and quality of wildlife experience matched nowhere else on the continent.',
